LUMA SUMMARY:
Duckmail design and ecosystem session. The crew discusses the QSL role, packaging, and the now-stable 2.0 concept. A new future issue is identified: multiple Minds may share one browser address, so address identity and separate mail streams may eventually need explicit treatment. The session closes with a search for Ada-Mant.
